             Dear {!Contact.FirstName},  <br /><br />

If you are in need of a replacement card, please visit the <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/cardservices#replacement-cards">
Replacement</a> section of our website.<br/><br/>

If you wish to pick up your card at one of our four campus locations, please fill out a <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/webform/basic-sun-card-office-pick-form">
Pickup Form</a>.<br/><br/>

If you would like your card to be mailed to you, please fill out a <a href="https://cfo.asu.edu/campus-id-card-request-form">
Mailing Form</a>.<br/><br/>

After we have processed your request, we will send you a confirmation email. A fee of $25.00 will be applied to your account within a few business days.<br/><br/>
Regards, <br />
 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
